            <ArticleTitle>A Step-by-Step Multiple Stimuli-Responsive Nanoplatform for Enhancing Combined Chemo-Photodynamic Therapy.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/adma.201605357</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A robust and smart protoporphyrin-based polymer nanoplatform, which is capable of successively recognizing the variation of biological signals and reacting with them in a dynamic mode, is successfully developed. It combines the chemotherapy and photodynamic therapy in a same system, leading to a high treatment outcome while a low adverse side effect of therapeutic agent.</AbstractText>
